@startuml
title Statechart diagram of Video Suggestion System

[*] --> Idle : «M» Initial State/

state Idle
state ProcessingRequest
state GatheringVideos
state AddingDetails
state SendingSuggestions
state Completed

Idle --> ProcessingRequest : «M» Receive Request/
ProcessingRequest --> GatheringVideos : «M» User Identified/
GatheringVideos --> AddingDetails : «M» Videos Gathered/
AddingDetails --> SendingSuggestions : «M» Details Added/
SendingSuggestions --> Completed : «M» Suggestions Sent/
Completed --> [*] : «M» Process Complete/

@enduml
